{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfSaCxV6GUKzSRnbzGLS5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests passed. Let me verify the implementation by checking what was changed:\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — Verified: `./mvnw test` executed successfully with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — Verified: All 21 tests pass, including the 4 existing OrderControllerTest tests and 5 existing ShipmentControllerTest tests\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel** cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels CREATED shipments — Implemented in OrderController.cancel() with tests:\n   - `cancels an active order and returns it with CANCELLED status`\n   - `cancelling an order cancels all created shipments`\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent** — Uses existing ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) patterns; added ORDER_CANCELLED and SHIPMENT_CONFIRMED error codes\n5. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds, blocked cancel changes nothing, unknown order refused, shipment for cancelled order refused** — Tested by:\n   - `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds with idempotent response`\n   - `cancelling an order with a confirmed shipment returns 409 and changes nothing`\n   - `cancelling a non-existent order returns 404`\n   - `rejects shipment creation for cancelled order with 409`\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only modified Kotlin code, no pom.xml changes\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Modified only:\n   - `Order.kt` - Added status field and OrderStatus enum\n   - `OrderController.kt` - Added cancel endpoint\n   - `OrderRepository.kt` - NOT changed (no method needed there)\n   - `ShipmentRepository.kt` - Added findByOrderId() method\n   - `ShipmentController.kt` - Added order cancellation check\n   - `ApiError.kt` - Added error codes\n   - Test files only (allowed)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** — ✅ Had to change: Added `status: OrderStatus` field and `OrderStatus` enum. This is required by the ticket.\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** — ✅ Had to change: Added cancel endpoint and injected ShipmentRepository. Required by ticket.\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — ✅ Had to change: Added `findByOrderId()` method to support finding shipments by order. Required to implement the cancel logic.\n\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** — ✅ Had to change: Added check for cancelled orders before creating shipments. Required by ticket (\"Once an order is CANCELLED, creating a shipment for it is rejected with HTTP 409\").\n\n5. **ApiError.kt** — ✅ Had to change: Added `ORDER_CANCELLED` and `SHIPMENT_CONFIRMED` error codes. Required for proper error responses.\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — ✅ Test file: Added 6 new tests for the cancel functionality plus reset shipmentRepository in setup.\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — ✅ Test file: Added 2 new tests for shipment creation with cancelled orders and reset orderRepository in setup.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements have been addressed.\n\nLet me verify the test coverage more carefully by examining the test output:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3330,"cache_read_input_tokens":35523,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3330},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cced31fe-3160-4f89-9549-305ab5c4f960","uuid":"c51e4df8-ea29-427a-b000-45de0ab8aa52","timestamp":"2026-09-26T19:05:54.932Z","request_id":"req_011CfSaCx1Zaqr4bNJKTQHrb"}
